# 低频词汇 List08
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024恋练有词
# 描述: 低频词汇List08核心词汇

{{dismiss}}{/dɪsˈmɪs/}{解雇；驳回}{The court dismissed the case due to lack of evidence.}}
{{displace}}{/dɪsˈpleɪs/}{取代；迫使离开}{The flood displaced thousands of families.}}
{{disposal}}{/dɪˈspəʊzl/}{处理；处置}{Proper disposal of waste is essential for environmental protection.}}
{{dispute}}{/dɪˈspjuːt/}{争端；争议}{The dispute between the two companies was settled out of court.}}
{{disrupt}}{/dɪsˈrʌpt/}{扰乱；破坏}{The new technology disrupted the traditional retail industry.}}
{{dissolve}}{/dɪˈzɒlv/}{溶解；解散}{The parliament voted to dissolve the current government.}}
{{distinct}}{/dɪˈstɪŋkt/}{不同的；明显的}{The region has a distinct cultural identity.}}
{{distort}}{/dɪˈstɔːt/}{歪曲；扭曲}{The media can distort the facts to fit a narrative.}}
{{distress}}{/dɪˈstres/}{苦恼；危难}{The ship sent a distress signal before sinking.}}
{{divert}}{/daɪˈvɜːt/}{转移；使转向}{Traffic was diverted to an alternate route.}}
{{doctrine}}{/ˈdɒktrɪn/}{教义；学说}{The political doctrine shaped the nation's foreign policy.}}
{{domain}}{/dəˈmeɪn/}{领域；域}{Artificial intelligence is expanding into new domains.}}
{{dominate}}{/ˈdɒmɪneɪt/}{支配；占主导地位}{A few large firms dominate the industry.}}
{{donate}}{/dəʊˈneɪt/}{捐赠；捐献}{The company donated equipment to local schools.}}
{{doom}}{/duːm/}{厄运；注定}{The project was doomed to failure from the start.}}
{{drain}}{/dreɪn/}{排水；耗尽}{The constant demands drained her energy.}}
{{drift}}{/drɪft/}{漂流；趋势}{The conversation drifted to unrelated topics.}}
{{drought}}{/draʊt/}{干旱；旱灾}{The severe drought destroyed most of the crops.}}
{{dwell}}{/dwel/}{居住；详述}{The article dwells on the negative aspects of the policy.}}
{{dynamic}}{/daɪˈnæmɪk/}{动态的；有活力的}{The market is dynamic and constantly evolving.}}
{{elaborate}}{/ɪˈlæbərət/}{精心制作的；详细阐述}{The scientist elaborated on the methodology of the study.}}
{{elect}}{/ɪˈlekt/}{选举；选择}{The members elected a new chairperson.}}
{{elegant}}{/ˈelɪɡənt/}{优雅的；精美的}{The solution was elegant in its simplicity.}}
{{eligible}}{/ˈelɪdʒəbl/}{有资格的；合格的}{Only registered members are eligible to vote.}}
{{embed}}{/ɪmˈbed/}{嵌入；使深入}{The values are deeply embedded in the culture.}}
{{embody}}{/ɪmˈbɒdi/}{体现；使具体化}{The leader embodies the spirit of the movement.}}
{{emission}}{/ɪˈmɪʃn/}{排放；散发}{The factory reduced its greenhouse gas emissions significantly.}}
{{emit}}{/ɪˈmɪt/}{发出；散发}{The device emits a signal every few seconds.}}
{{empower}}{/ɪmˈpaʊər/}{赋权；使能够}{Education empowers individuals to shape their own futures.}}
{{enact}}{/ɪˈnækt/}{颁布；制定}{The government enacted new environmental protection laws.}}
